      "product_summary": "Low-top mesh lace-up casual shoes with patterned upper openings and a thick sole profile. The side-panel outline and heel pull loop add visible structure to the knit-like mesh appearance. Mesh lining and an EVA midsole are specified, with Black and Beige choices through EU 39–48.",
